526		% Reliance disclosure added: the proof chain of thm:pauli passes through
527		% lem:qld-4-7, whose source proof (lines 1277--1413 of
528		% 14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex) instantiates the classical low
529		% individual degree test at dimension 2m+2 without a divisibility
530		% hypothesis; the sentence below records the resulting outstanding
531		% obligation.
