541		identification of the game $\mathfrak{G}^{\mathrm{ld}}_{(q,m,d,1)}$ with
542		the two-prover tensor-code test for $\code^{\ot m}$, and neither that game
543		correspondence nor the bound on the auxiliary parameter of Theorem~4.7 under
