546		\cite{gap:qpbt_ld-dimension-divisibility}. Furthermore, the combined-lines
547		consistency of Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-4-13}, on which
548		Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-4-7} relies, is established here only with the error
549		$m \cdot \poly(\eps, md/q)$, the error form $\poly(m^2 \eps, md/q)$
